# 📄 PRD – Automation Testing Flow (Trial Signup – Clean & Legal)

## 🎯 Objective

Menguji end-to-end flow:
**akses trial → registrasi → verifikasi → login → aktivasi subscription (sandbox)**
menggunakan automation berbasis browser.

---

## 🧪 Flow Utama (Rewritten – Legal)

### 1. Buka browser dengan clean session (incognito/context baru)

* Tujuan: tidak ada cache/cookie
* Implementasi: Playwright `newContext()`

---

### 2. Set environment testing (bukan VPN bypass)

* Gunakan:

  * `staging` / `sandbox` environment
* Config via `.env`:

```
BASE_URL=https://staging.app.com
```

---

### 3. Akses halaman trial / pricing resmi

* Endpoint valid (misal `/trial`)
* Validasi:

  * page load sukses
  * CTA “Start Free Trial” muncul

---

### 4. Klik tombol “Start Free Trial / Claim Trial”

* Assert:

  * tombol visible
  * redirect ke halaman signup

---

### 5. Isi form registrasi (test data valid & unik)

* Gunakan data generator (faker):

  * email: random
  * nama: valid format
  * password: sesuai policy
* Submit form

---

### 6. Login / auto-login setelah registrasi

* Jika auto-login:

  * validasi redirect ke dashboard
* Jika manual:

  * isi email & password
  * klik login
* Assert login sukses

---

### 7. Handle proteksi sistem secara legal (captcha/anti-bot)

* ❌ Tidak bypass captcha
* ✅ Gunakan:

  * test mode captcha (jika ada)
  * atau disable di environment staging
* Tujuan: tetap valid tanpa melanggar sistem

---

### 8. Verifikasi OTP (email/SMS testing)

* Gunakan:

  * email testing service (Mailtrap/Mailhog)
  * atau mock OTP API
* Ambil OTP secara programmatic
* Input ke form verifikasi
* Assert verifikasi sukses

---

### 9. Pilih metode pembayaran (sandbox mode)

* Gunakan payment gateway test:

  * contoh kartu test (sandbox)
* Tidak menggunakan data real
* Tidak ada manipulasi billing

---

### 10. Konfirmasi aktivasi trial / subscription

* Validasi:

  * status: “Trial Active” / “Subscribed”
  * UI dashboard berubah sesuai

---

### 11. Simpan hasil test (logging, bukan akun eksploit)

* Simpan ke file:

  * JSON / log / report
* Contoh:

```
{
  "email": "test123@mail.com",
  "status": "trial_active"
}
```

---

## ⚠️ Constraints (Wajib Dipatuhi)

### ❌ Tidak boleh:

* bypass captcha
* gunakan OTP tidak sah
* manipulasi pembayaran
* abuse trial berkali-kali di sistem real

### ✅ Harus:

* pakai sandbox / staging
* pakai test data
* comply dengan Terms of Service

---

## 🧰 Tools & Stack

* Playwright / Selenium
* Faker.js (data generator)
* Mailtrap / Mailhog (email testing)
* Payment sandbox (misal Stripe)

---

## 📊 Expected Result

* Semua step berjalan tanpa error
* User berhasil:

  * register
  * verify
  * login
  * activate trial

